        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our Pathway Programs help foster economic mobility in the communities in which we operate and create a more robust talent pipeline for our business drawing from untapped talent pipelines including veterans, which consists of individuals who have served in the military and the caregivers and spouses of those who have served in the military, as well as people with disabilities, youth and displaced persons.",
