        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our existing hotel system and development pipeline, which will require minimal capital investment from us, positions us to further improve and grow our business, allocate capital effectively and meet our customers' demands and preferences in the future.",
        "start_character": 4517,
        "end_character": 4786
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to review our benefits and programmatic offerings to ensure we remain competitive, are investing in our employees' development and well-being and are enhancing our recruiting strategies to tap into new pools of talent.",
        "start_character": 23876,
        "end_character": 24106
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business through: (i) a management and franchise segment and (ii) an ownership segment, each of which is reported as a segment based on (a) delivering a similar set of products and services and (b) being managed separately given its distinct economic characteristics.",
        "start_character": 825,
        "end_character": 1107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We take a broad, long-term and business-aligned approach to develop a dedicated and collaborative workforce to better serve our guests.",
        "start_character": 26260,
        "end_character": 26395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In certain cases, we are both the franchisor and manager of the hotel, when we enter into a franchise contract in addition to the management contract, and, in these cases, we classify the hotel as managed in our system.",
        "start_character": 14907,
        "end_character": 15126
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The advancement of our employees is important to us and we provide them with robust learning and development opportunities, including mentorship opportunities.",
        "start_character": 26804,
        "end_character": 26963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001585689-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001585689-26-000007-c8d441b8b703dbcc",
        "accession_number": "0001585689-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
